OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrian hit
OL,4,Aby car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian suffered life-threatening
OL,8,Finjuries in a suspected hit and run.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,F45-year-old man being hit by a blue
OL,12,FRange Rover as he crossed Freeman
OL,13,FStreet, Grimsby, at about 23:45 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday, before the driver left the
OL,15,Fscene in the car.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Humberside Police
OL,18,Fsaid a 37-year-old man had been
OL,19,F"arrested on suspicion of several road
OL,20,Ftraffic offences".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
