OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrian hit
OL,4,Aby car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident happened at the junction
OL,7,Fwith Wood Street. Officers are
OL,8,Fappealing for witnesses and dashcam
OL,9,Ffootage.
